            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Konye do awatekosi cputosi bala awat nuka iinacanakosi, ka idwekosi kwape idwekec: ido koany, kitubuleseni idwekosi lusap ka lupesur araut ibulesin, ido ace kadwekosi adaut aitubulesenio: ido emamei sio nukiswamai aitikokinia; naarai ejaas icetuŋa kimanikoriakosi ka amanatakosi nuka emusabibu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
