        },
        {
          "text": " Katema kes atiar, “Kipou isio kalakutu kwape kipedoria ikosiinaean Iyudayan, luagwelaritai mama ejaas ikapirin; yes da ikotosi agwelar iinaeanakus, ti kereka kigwele isio kes?” Kosodete kesi aililiŋ, mam apotu kobonokis akirot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.8",
