        {
          "text": " Abu da kelakilak ekagoe kener atiar, “Kilakilakakini Edeke kwaŋin ninitunanan kotogoke, kotoma aswamisioke, yenimam itodolikini aisumunet na; kilakilakakinio kwaŋin, adaun.” Kobala ekodet kere ebe, “Amen.” Kituroto EJAKAIT. Kiswamata do ituŋa kwape esumunioto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.13",
